data: {"id": "5392468fbb604167-thinking-parallel_evidence-538", "run_id": "5392468fbb604167", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 关键事实 | 与候选原因关系 |\n|------|---------|--------------|\n| **Pod 状态** | phase=Pending, nodeName=None, PodScheduled=False | 支持 Pending 异常 |\n| **Prometheus** | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}=1`, UID=`b2f83678-...` | 确认当前仍 Pending，UID 一致无重用 |\n| **Events** | `FailedScheduling` (20m 前及 9m52s x2) 原文: `\"persistentvolumeclaim \\\"unavailable-claim\\\" not found\"` | **直接原因定位** |\n| **Pod YAML** | Volumes 含 `persistentVolumeClaim: unavailable-claim`，无 nodeSelector/affinity/taint 问题 | 确认 PVC", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789114955983, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

